        <span itemprop="subject">the A layer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">contains a polypropylene, based on the total weight of the resin components constituting the A layer, in an amount of preferably 0% by weight or more and less than 3% by weight, more preferably 0% by weight or more and less than 1% by weight, and most preferably the layer A does not contain a polypropylene.</span>
