      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the lower limit of the amount of polypropylene contained in the B layer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is preferably 1% by weight or more, more preferably 3% by weight or more, still more preferably 4% by weight or more, even still more preferably 5% by weight or more, and most preferably 10% by weight or more, based on the total weight of resin components constituting the B layer.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0068">
