      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the upper limit of the amount of polypropylene contained in the B layer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is preferably 30% by weight or less, more preferably 27% by weight or less, still more preferably 25% by weight or less, even still more preferably 20% by weight or less, and most preferably 18% by weight or less, based on the total weight of resin components constituting the B layer.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0068">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the layer B</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">contains polypropylene in a range of, for example, 1% by weight or more and 30% by weight or less, or 1% by weight or more and less than 30% by weight, and preferably 5% by weight or more and less than 30% by weight, more preferably 5% by weight and 25% by weight or less, and still more preferably 10% by weight or more and 20% by weight or less.</span>
