        <span itemprop="subject">a polyolefin microporous membrane having sufficient strength</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">can be obtained, and when the molecular weight is 10,000,000 or less, the internal stress upon stretching does not become excessively large, thereby excessive heat shrinkage can be prevented.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0070">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the polyethylene</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">has a molecular weight distribution (Mw/Mn) of preferably 20 or less, more preferably 17 or less, still more preferably 14 or less, even still more preferably 10 or less, and most preferably 8 or less, and preferably 2 or more, more preferably 3 or more, and still more preferably 4 or more.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0070">
