        <span itemprop="subject">the amount of UHMWPE</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is preferably less than 30% by weight, more preferably less than 20% by weight, and even more preferably less than 10% by weight, based on the total weight of the polyolefin in the B layer.</span>
