        <span itemprop="subject">the amount of LDPE</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is preferably 25% by weight or less, more preferably 20% by weight or less, still more preferably 15% by weight or less, and even still more preferably 10% by weight or less, based on the total weight of the polyolefin in the A layer.</span>
