      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the content of the inorganic particles</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is less than 5% by weight, it is possible to effectively prevent batteries from swelling, etc., due to gas generation. This effect becomes more remarkable in a laminated battery, which the external body thereof is easily deformed.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0078">
