        <span itemprop="definition">has a melt index (MI) under a load of 21.6 kgf at 190° C., which is preferably 0.01 g/10 min or more and 3.0 g/10 min or less, more preferably 0.05 g/10 min or more and 1.5 g/10 min or less, still more preferably 0.1 g/10 min or more and 0.6 g/10 min or less, and most preferably 0.12 g/10 min or more and 0.5 g/10 min or less.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0081">
