        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0193">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the sheet</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was dried and stretched 1.5 times in the width direction (TD) at a strain rate of 17.0%/sec at 120° C. by a tenter stretching machine. Thereafter, the stretched sheet was subjected to heat treatment where the sheet was relaxed in the width direction (TD) at the strain rate of 0.3%/sec at 133° C. so as to be relaxed 0.9 times in the width after the transverse stretching to obtain a single layer polyolefin microporous membrane.</span>
